# eql-log-reader
===
 A log parser for EverQuest Legends which serves to showcase damage dealt. Also provides a floating Friends list which lists online/offline status and a session summary readout, a map viewer that shows maps in 3D, tracks your drops, shows you where to find items, and teaches you how to and where to complete quests.
===
